<title>NETHERLANDS: PHILIPS STEADY DESPITE Q4 LOSS.</title>
<headline>PHILIPS STEADY DESPITE Q4 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Philips Electronics NV hovered around Wednesday's closing level of 78.10 guilders on Thursday after the company reported a fourth quarter loss.</p>
